{"id":"0fab5c338808585f","group":"93","path":"93/93-df-maximal-clone.md","title":"Maximal Proper Clone","display":"df-maximal-clone — Maximal Proper Clone","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Algebraizable Logics","book_abbrev":"93","label":"93-df-maximal-clone","aliases":["93-df-maximal-clone"],"display":"df-maximal-clone — Maximal Proper Clone","depends_on":["[[93-df-clone]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Algebraizable Logics"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"93"},{"key":"label","html":"93-df-maximal-clone"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>93-df-maximal-clone</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-maximal-clone — Maximal Proper Clone"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"ee2f4c926e0e30e6\" href=\"?note=ee2f4c926e0e30e6\" title=\"93-df-clone\">93-df-clone</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\neq\\varnothing\">\\(A\\neq\\varnothing\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal O_A\">\\(\\mathcal O_A\\)</span> is the set of all finitary operations on <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span>, defined here.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Clone}\">\\(\\mathrm{Clone}\\)</span> is the clone predicate of <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"ee2f4c926e0e30e6\" href=\"?note=ee2f4c926e0e30e6\" title=\"93-df-clone\">93-df-clone</a>.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{GenClone}_{93}\">\\(\\mathrm{GenClone}_{93}\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{MaxPropClone}_{93}\">\\(\\mathrm{MaxPropClone}_{93}\\)</span> are defined here.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{GenClone}_{93}(D,A)\">\\(\\mathrm{GenClone}_{93}(D,A)\\)</span> 的定义域为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\neq\\varnothing\">\\(A\\neq\\varnothing\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D\\subseteq\\mathcal O_A\">\\(D\\subseteq\\mathcal O_A\\)</span>。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}maximal\\text{-}clone}\\vdash\n\\mathcal O_A\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{n\\in\\omega}(A^n\\to A)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}maximal\\text{-}clone}\\vdash\n\\mathcal O_A\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{n\\in\\omega}(A^n\\to A)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}maximal\\text{-}clone}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{GenClone}_{93}(D,A)\\coloneqq\n\\bigcap\\{E\\subseteq\\mathcal O_A:\\mathrm{Clone}(E,A)\\land D\\subseteq E\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}maximal\\text{-}clone}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{GenClone}_{93}(D,A)\\coloneqq\n\\bigcap\\{E\\subseteq\\mathcal O_A:\\mathrm{Clone}(E,A)\\land D\\subseteq E\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}maximal\\text{-}clone}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{MaxPropClone}_{93}(C,A)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{Clone}(C,A)\\land C\\subsetneq\\mathcal O_A\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall E\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{Clone}(E,A)\\land C\\subseteq E\\subsetneq\\mathcal O_A\\to E=C\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}maximal\\text{-}clone}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{MaxPropClone}_{93}(C,A)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{Clone}(C,A)\\land C\\subsetneq\\mathcal O_A\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall E\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{Clone}(E,A)\\land C\\subseteq E\\subsetneq\\mathcal O_A\\to E=C\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"A\\neq\\varnothing\\land D\\subseteq\\mathcal O_A\\to\n\\bigl(\\mathrm{Clone}(\\mathcal O_A,A)\\land\n\\mathrm{Clone}(\\mathrm{GenClone}_{93}(D,A),A)\\land\nD\\subseteq\\mathrm{GenClone}_{93}(D,A)\\bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[A\\neq\\varnothing\\land D\\subseteq\\mathcal O_A\\to\n\\bigl(\\mathrm{Clone}(\\mathcal O_A,A)\\land\n\\mathrm{Clone}(\\mathrm{GenClone}_{93}(D,A),A)\\land\nD\\subseteq\\mathrm{GenClone}_{93}(D,A)\\bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The generated-clone operator is the intersection of all clones containing its argument. Maximality is taken only among proper clones on the same base set.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"93-df-clone","status":"resolved","id":"ee2f4c926e0e30e6","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[93-df-clone]]","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-clone","status":"resolved","id":"ee2f4c926e0e30e6","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Clone}$ is the clone predicate of [[93-df-clone]].","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"A\\neq\\varnothing","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal O_A","display":false},{"tex":"A","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Clone}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{GenClone}_{93}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{MaxPropClone}_{93}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{GenClone}_{93}(D,A)","display":false},{"tex":"A\\neq\\varnothing","display":false},{"tex":"D\\subseteq\\mathcal O_A","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}maximal\\text{-}clone}\\vdash\n\\mathcal O_A\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{n\\in\\omega}(A^n\\to A)","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}maximal\\text{-}clone}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{GenClone}_{93}(D,A)\\coloneqq\n\\bigcap\\{E\\subseteq\\mathcal O_A:\\mathrm{Clone}(E,A)\\land D\\subseteq E\\}","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}maximal\\text{-}clone}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{MaxPropClone}_{93}(C,A)\\leftrightarrow{}&\n\\mathrm{Clone}(C,A)\\land C\\subsetneq\\mathcal O_A\\\\\n&\\land\\forall E\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{Clone}(E,A)\\land C\\subseteq E\\subsetneq\\mathcal O_A\\to E=C\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"A\\neq\\varnothing\\land D\\subseteq\\mathcal O_A\\to\n\\bigl(\\mathrm{Clone}(\\mathcal O_A,A)\\land\n\\mathrm{Clone}(\\mathrm{GenClone}_{93}(D,A),A)\\land\nD\\subseteq\\mathrm{GenClone}_{93}(D,A)\\bigr)","display":true}],"bytes":1542,"backlinks":[{"id":"03ecb67f86ea10f0","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":3,"excerpt":"$A$ is a nonempty set, $\\mathcal O_A$ is the all-finitary-operations class defined in [[93-df-maximal-clone]], and $\\mathrm{Clone}(C,A)$."}],"outgoing":["ee2f4c926e0e30e6"]}